  and fixed its install target (wrong man page source and section);
  install desktop file and icon, pass PREFIX/BINDIR/MANDIR/DATADIR
- Refreshed galaxis-galaxis.c.patch context for the new sources
- Fix License tag to BSD-2-Clause to match COPYING
- BuildRequire rubygem(asciidoctor) to generate the man page,
  plus gcc, make and pkgconfig(ncurses)

